<section class="optimization">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="optimization__main">

            <div class="optimization__content">

                <div class="optimization__eyebrow">
                    <span>08</span>
                    Design that costs less to build
                </div>

                <h2 class="optimization__title">
                    Optimizing the spec isn't the same as cutting the design.
                </h2>

                <div class="optimization__text">

                    <p>
                        A bloated quote doesn't survive being compared against other suppliers, so proposing one costs us the tender, not just your trust — right-sizing your spec is how we win the work, not a favor on top of it. It comes back in tiers, not one number, because there's more than one way to hit a budget without touching the design intent. On a real 45-room hotel, a moderate pass on construction and materials cut the furniture spec by 23%; pushing further — different joinery, different install method, same nine pieces per room — got to 26%. Original spec: roughly $247,500. Re-engineered: $182,200-191,600.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Your own range depends on what you're willing to trade at each tier and your own materials — this is what it looked like on one real project, not a promised percentage.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="optimization__stat">

                <div class="optimization__number">
                    23-26<span>%</span>
                </div>

                <div class="optimization__label">
                    Cost reduction on a real 45-room hotel fit-out<br>
                    in Bali — without changing the design
                </div>

                <a href="#contact" class="optimization__button">
                    Optimize my project's budget
                </a>

            </div>

        </div>

        <ul class="optimization__results">

            <li class="optimization__result">
                <h3 class="optimization__result-number">
                    -37%
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Entry door — hidden-mount instead of sliding-in-frame
                </p>
            </li>

            <li class="optimization__result">
                <h3 class="optimization__result-number">
                    -33%
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Sofa — matched stitch detail instead of deep tufting
                </p>
            </li>

            <li class="optimization__result">
                <h3 class="optimization__result-number">
                    -29%
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Wardrobe — modular 6-panel build, 2 installers not 3
                </p>
            </li>

            <li class="optimization__result">
                <h3 class="optimization__result-number">
                    -23%
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Kitchen unit — fluted wet-zone facade swapped for a flat panel + marble backsplash
                </p>

            </li>

        </ul>

    </div>

</section>

<style>

    .optimization {
        background-color: #F4F3F0;
        border-bottom: 0.05rem solid #888888;
    }

    .optimization .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 140rem;
        padding: 0 2rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .optimization__main {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 58% 42%;
    }

    .optimization__content {
        padding: 10rem 10rem 10rem 0;
    }

    .optimization__eyebrow {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        color: #58585A;
        font-family: 'TT Firs Neue', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 6rem;
    }

    .optimization__eyebrow::before {
        content: "";
        width: 2rem;
        height: 0.1rem;
        background-color: #888888;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .optimization__eyebrow span {
        color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .optimization__title {
        max-width: 80rem;
        color: #151516;
        font-size: clamp(4.2rem, 4.4vw, 5.2rem);
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .optimization__text {
        max-width: 90rem;
    }

    .optimization__text p {
        color: #58585A;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .optimization__text p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .optimization__stat {
        border-left: 0.05rem solid #888;
        padding: 17rem 0 10rem 8rem;
    }

    .optimization__number {
        color: #151516;
        font-family: 'TT Firs Neue', sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(10rem, 11vw, 12.8rem);
        line-height: 1.1;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .optimization__number span {
        color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .optimization__label {
        color: #58585A;
        font-family: 'TT Firs Neue', sans-serif;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 6rem;
    }

    .optimization__button {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        padding: 1.5rem 2.7rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        border: 0.1rem solid #888888;
        background-color: transparent;
        color: #151516;
        text-decoration: none;
        cursor: pointer;

        transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .optimization__button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .optimization__results {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
    }

    .optimization__results::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 50%;
        width: 100vw;
        height: 0.05rem;
        background-color: #888888;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    .optimization__result {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 4rem;
        gap: 1.2rem;
        border-right: 0.05rem solid #888888;
    }

    .optimization__result:last-child {
        border-right: none;
    }

    .optimization__result-number {
        font-family: 'TT Firs Neue', sans-serif;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .optimization__result p {
        color: #58585A;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {

        .optimization__main {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .optimization__content {
            padding: 6rem 0 0;
        }

        .optimization__eyebrow {
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .optimization__title {
            max-width: 100%;
            font-size: 3.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .optimization__text {
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        .optimization__text p {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .optimization__stat {
            border-left: none;
            border-top: 0.05rem solid #888888;
            padding: 3.2rem 0 6rem;
            margin-top: 3.6rem;
        }

        .optimization__number {
            font-size: 8rem;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .optimization__label {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .optimization__button {
            width: 100%;
            transition: none;
        }

        .optimization__button:hover {
            transform: none;
        }

        .optimization__results {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            margin: 0 -2rem;
            border-top: 0.05rem solid #888888;
            
        }

        .optimization__results::before {
            display: none;
        }

        .optimization__result {
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            border-right: none;
            border-bottom: 0.05rem solid #888888;
        }

        .optimization__result:nth-child(even) {
            border-left: 0.05rem solid #888888;
        }

        .optimization__result:nth-last-child(-n+2) {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .optimization__result-number {
            font-size: 3.6rem;
        }

        .optimization__result p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {

        .optimization__number {
            font-size: 8rem;
        }
    }


</style>